---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/sections/Hero.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import Card from '../components/ui/Card.astro';
import Heading from '../components/ui/Heading.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Services | Geek Life Development"
  description="Explore professional websites, practical business applications, and ongoing support delivered with clear scope and reliable communication."
>
  <Hero
    title="Services built for small businesses that want clear, reliable results"
    subtitle="We help business owners in Ozaukee County, Milwaukee, and beyond launch professional websites, practical business applications, and ongoing support that keeps both improving over time."
    primaryCta={{ label: 'Get a quote', href: '/contact' }}
    secondaryCta={{ label: 'Talk through your project', href: siteConfig.phoneHref }}
    accent={false}
  />

  <Section>
    <div id="websites" class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Websites"
        title="Professional websites that build trust and turn visitors into inquiries"
        subtitle="Your site should build trust quickly, explain what you do, and make it easy for people to take the next step."
      />

      <Card hover={false}>
        <p class="label-mono text-slate-500">Typical website engagement includes</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li>• Clear page structure and strong business messaging</li>
          <li>• A polished experience across phone, tablet, and desktop</li>
          <li>• Search-friendly setup for long-term visibility</li>
          <li>• Ongoing support options for updates and improvements</li>
        </ul>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl space-y-4">
      <p>
        This is a strong fit for businesses that want a professional online presence without constant rework.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
        Not sure what you need yet? <a href={siteConfig.phoneHref} class="font-medium">Give me a call.</a>
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We focus on practical scope and dependable delivery.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="muted">
    <div class="space-y-10">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Business applications"
        title="Practical business applications built around how your team actually works"
        subtitle="When your team needs more than a brochure site, we can add focused tools that support daily operations without unnecessary complexity."
      />

      <div id="business-applications" class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Customer and contact management</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Tools for tracking customer details, follow-ups, and relationship history.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Scheduling and workflows</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Simple systems that make scheduling, routing, and task handoffs easier.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Forms and data collection</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Better intake and handoff flows for leads, requests, and client updates.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Internal dashboards</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">A central view of the information your team needs to make decisions quickly.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Volunteer or member management</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Practical tools for organizations that manage people, schedules, and participation.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Replacing manual processes</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Solutions that help replace spreadsheets, repeated copy-and-paste work, and disconnected systems.</p>
        </Card>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <p>We keep scope focused on the most valuable business outcome first, then expand as needed.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          Questions? <a href={siteConfig.phoneHref} class="font-medium">Call and we can talk it through.</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Larger custom platforms are scoped as separate engagements.</p>
        <Button href="/contact">Discuss your idea</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <div id="ongoing-support" class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Ongoing support"
        title="Ongoing support that keeps your website or business application current"
        subtitle="After launch, we provide steady monthly support so your website or business application stays polished, accurate, secure, and useful."
      />

      <Card hover={false}>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li>• Monthly updates and quality checks</li>
          <li>• Content, data, and layout improvements</li>
          <li>• Hosting guidance, launch support, and troubleshooting</li>
          <li>• Ongoing performance and reliability reviews</li>
        </ul>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-4xl">
      Most clients get better long-term results with ongoing support than one-time updates every few months.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
      Want to talk before requesting a quote? <a href={siteConfig.phoneHref} class="font-medium">Call {siteConfig.phoneDisplay}</a>.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="muted">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Boundaries"
        title="Clear boundaries, better projects"
        subtitle="Clear boundaries protect timelines, budgets, and outcomes for everyone involved."
      />
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <Card hover={false} class="p-5">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">No vague scope</p>
        </Card>
        <Card hover={false} class="p-5">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">No unclear deliverables</p>
        </Card>
        <Card hover={false} class="p-5">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">No surprise process changes</p>
        </Card>
        <Card hover={false} class="p-5">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-900">No rushed project delivery</p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="dark">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-white">When communication is clear, projects move smoothly.</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <Button href="/contact" size="lg">Get a quote</Button>
        <Button href={siteConfig.phoneHref} size="lg" variant="secondary">Call now</Button>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Reach out whichever way is easiest: call, text, or form.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>